AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setAuthorizedCallback()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnsupportedOperation for every callback and status
    ├── it should reject zero and nonzero callback addresses with the same unsupported error
    ├── it should leave authorizedCallbacks false
    ├── it should not emit SetAuthorizedCallback
    └── it should remain unsupported while paused or frozen
